WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.830
Harry Kersh: From McDonald's to Domino's,

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.100
we wanted to find out all the biggest

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.210
portion-size differences

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.340
between UK and US fast food.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.840
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.500
This is what a small drink
looks like in the UK.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.113
Joe Avella: This is a US small.

00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:18.790
Harry: This is what a
medium drink looks like.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.302
Joe: This is a US medium.

00:00:21.302 --> 00:00:22.997
Harry: And this is a large.

00:00:22.997 --> 00:00:25.472
Joe: [groaning] And this

00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:27.274
is a US large.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.000
Harry: So, with our McNuggets in the UK,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.593
the default adult sizes on the menu

00:00:36.593 --> 00:00:38.600
are a box of six,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.670
a box of nine,

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.563
or a share box of 20.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.840
Joe: Nuggets.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.860
You can get a box of four,

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.200
or you can get a six piece,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.010
or

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.130
10,

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.689
20, for "sharing,"

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:55.297
or

00:00:55.297 --> 00:00:57.047
[groans]

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.060
40.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.010
And according to the three
McDonald's in the area,

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.010
they don't have 20 or 40 boxes.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.210
They just do them in increments of 10.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.156
But this is on the menu.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.270
Harry: Just out of curiosity,

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.595
we're gonna bring our trusty
friend the scales back,

00:01:12.595 --> 00:01:13.550
and we're gonna weigh the Big Mac

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.330
and see if there is
any difference in size.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:17.280
Not sure there will
be, but let's find out.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.164
[bell rings]

00:01:29.135 --> 00:01:30.739
Joe: Hang on, hang on, hang on.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.280
Harry: This is what a
regular popcorn chicken

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.017
looks like in the UK.

00:01:43.017 --> 00:01:46.172
And this is what a large
popcorn chicken looks like.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:50.470
Joe: In the US, we have
a large popcorn chicken,

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.800
and if you want to go even
larger than the large,

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:57.290
you can get yourself popcorn chicken box.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.686
Something for you and
your buddies, I'm sure.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.720
You're not eating this by yourself.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.430
Did I lose any?

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.263
No?

00:02:07.263 --> 00:02:08.480
No way, am I doing this without...

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.471
oh, don't jinx it!

00:02:10.471 --> 00:02:12.579
Aah, oh!

00:02:13.645 --> 00:02:14.583
You,

00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:15.606
and you,

00:02:15.606 --> 00:02:17.431
and you.

00:02:18.402 --> 00:02:19.466
Crumb?

00:02:19.466 --> 00:02:20.299
Crumb.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.630
Harry: This is a regular fries,

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:26.400
and this is a large fries.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.990
Joe: Here's the US regular.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.390
All right?

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.095
And you wanna go to the next size up,

00:02:31.095 --> 00:02:34.165
this is the US large.

00:02:34.165 --> 00:02:35.770
Goosh!

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.650
Look at how big that is.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.550
It's like five of those ones that he had.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.170
Slo-mo: Goosh!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.645
Harry: Let's find out
how much a large fries

00:02:42.645 --> 00:02:43.586
weighs in the UK.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.897
Joe: Let's weigh our large fry.

00:02:53.118 --> 00:02:53.951
Oh, man.

00:02:53.951 --> 00:02:55.292
Oh, ho, ho, ho, ho,

00:02:55.292 --> 00:02:56.684
ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:02:56.684 --> 00:02:59.894
They are packed in there,
dude! Look at that.

00:02:59.894 --> 00:03:02.040
Is that everything?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.780
Harry: In the UK, you can
get buckets in three sizes.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.020
You can get a six piece.

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:08.912
You can get a 10 piece.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.922
Or you can get a 14 piece.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.470
[groaning]

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.463
Joe: Eight piece.

00:03:33.049 --> 00:03:33.882
Whoa!

00:03:33.882 --> 00:03:35.473
[thuds]

00:03:35.473 --> 00:03:36.447
12 piece.

00:03:36.447 --> 00:03:38.390
Yep, yep, yep.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.390
This is --

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:40.790
I'm not gonna, I can't even dump it.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.790
Yo,

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.413
look how much chicken this is.

00:03:46.815 --> 00:03:48.732
Oh, my God, what a mess.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.630
Harry: In the UK, we
have three drink sizes.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.210
We have a small, which is 250 milliliters.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.843
Joe: This is a US small.

00:04:04.843 --> 00:04:06.134
Harry: We have a regular,

00:04:06.134 --> 00:04:07.545
which is 400 milliliters.

00:04:07.545 --> 00:04:10.434
Joe: This is a US medium.

00:04:10.434 --> 00:04:11.630
Harry: And we have a large.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.596
Joe: And here

00:04:12.596 --> 00:04:14.900
[groans]

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.780
is the US large.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.460
Burger King.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.710
Harry: Now, in the UK, we
have three sizes of fries,

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.170
small, regular, and large.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.273
Joe: Here's a Burger King small fry,

00:04:26.922 --> 00:04:29.525
here's a Burger King medium fry,

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:34.778
and a Burger King large fry.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.110
Harry: So, of the three sizes
of fries that we were given,

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:39.960
I'm actually not sure
which one is the regular

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.330
and which one is the small,

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.770
because these two kinda look identical.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:46.030
We're going to weigh them all.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.963
We're gonna start with
this orange-bottomed bag.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.331
80...

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.430
88 grams.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:59.820
Now we're gonna weigh the
slightly darker orange bag

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.395
and see which size this is.

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.110
So, there's only a 5-gram difference,

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.752
but this one is the small.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.455
So, a large fries in the UK

00:05:17.455 --> 00:05:19.346
looks like it's around 180 grams,

00:05:19.346 --> 00:05:21.020
which is double the regular.

00:05:21.882 --> 00:05:23.662
[beep] I broke the scale.

00:05:23.662 --> 00:05:24.645
[laughs]

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.870
We're actually having some
concerns about the sizes

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.520
of the fries in the UK,

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.380
because our measurements showed

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:39.390
that the lighter orange bag
actually contained more fries

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.710
than the darker orange bag.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.990
However, when lined up very
scientifically like this,

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.507
what we'll actually see is that

00:05:46.507 --> 00:05:49.540
the bag sizes go up in
that color order instead.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.540
So I think what's happened here is that

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:54.430
our small was actually
bigger than our regular.

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.730
Joe: Wow, a lot of fry
drama over there in the UK.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.100
As you can see from our sizes,

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.210
it's pretty obvious what the small,

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.300
medium, and large is,

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.167
but, of course, we're
still gonna weigh them.

00:06:02.167 --> 00:06:04.463
So let's start with the small fry.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.253
Yep.

00:06:07.253 --> 00:06:08.970
Whoa, rogue fry.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.479
And now the medium fry.

00:06:14.426 --> 00:06:15.668
You're making a face.

00:06:15.668 --> 00:06:17.200
I don't like that face.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.316
It's, like...

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.700
yeah, it's pretty similar.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.620
I know how we will solve this,

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.453
but not,

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:26.470
not that way.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.920
Over here. Burger King
is in the hot seat, baby!

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:31.180
Burger King's in the hot seat!

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.265
Large fries.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.849
So, I'm gonna do something
really tedious and boring.

00:06:36.849 --> 00:06:39.349
Two, three, four,

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:41.698
12, 13,

00:06:41.698 --> 00:06:43.550
20, 21, 22,

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.770
35 regulars,

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.163
10 kind of broken-up ones.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.770
One, two,

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.240
34 and 18?

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.662
But there were a lot of smaller ones.

00:06:53.662 --> 00:06:55.660
Producer: Arguably more than the medium.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.830
Joe: Whoa!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.200
That's pretty cold, Burger King.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.570
That is pretty cold.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.040
Don't act like you're surprised by this.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.020
And I know what they're gonna say.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:03.853
They're gonna be like,

00:07:03.853 --> 00:07:05.390
"Well, everyone who scoops it's different."

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.720
OK, but our scooper here

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:11.193
and their scooper in the
UK made a similar error.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.382
Hmm.

00:07:13.382 --> 00:07:15.273
Suspicious, right?

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.853
Frygate 2020!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.993
Harry: So, this is a Whopper in the UK.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.330
No, it's not, that's a Halloumi King.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.597
Is this the Whopper?

00:07:32.128 --> 00:07:34.840
Have they forgotten the f---ing Whoppers?

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.115
Burger King!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.700
So, what we're going to
do is weigh a Whopper

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.263
and see how much a
Whopper weighs in the UK.

00:07:43.263 --> 00:07:45.196
[thuds]

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.410
Joe: All right, let's take
a look at the US Whopper.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.360
First thing I'm gonna do,

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.268
I'm gonna weigh it.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.960
Oh, yeah.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.193
That's a Whopper.

00:07:57.283 --> 00:07:58.142
Booyah.

00:07:58.142 --> 00:07:59.360
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait,

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.251
gotta be scientific about it.

00:08:04.263 --> 00:08:06.730
Harry: This is the smallest
pizza you can get in the UK.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.020
It's called an individual,

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.020
and it measures 7 inches across.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.685
Joe: Our smallest is,
believe it or not, the small.

00:08:12.685 --> 00:08:17.250
Here it is, and it measures,
in diameter, 10 inches.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.770
Harry: The next size up is a small,

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.410
which measures 9.5 inches.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.380
Joe: Next size up for
the US is our medium,

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:27.388
which is 12 inches.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.773
Harry: This is 11.5 inches.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.640
Joe: What? I'm starving.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:37.673
Hey,

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.820
I grabbed a slice.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.510
I'm starving. This pizza smells so good.

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:43.991
I skipped breakfast.

00:08:43.991 --> 00:08:45.430
[clapping hands]

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.560
Next pizza.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.090
Next up for the US is our large,

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.860
which is a 14-inch diameter.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.470
Oh, hell, yeah.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.780
What's with the way they
cut your large pizza, Harry?

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:57.110
It's ridiculous. Look at that.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.610
And not to be outdone,

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:00.620
the US has one more size,

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.855
the extra large,

00:09:01.855 --> 00:09:04.753
diameter 16 inches.

00:09:04.753 --> 00:09:07.487
Bro, look at the size of this thing.

00:09:09.191 --> 00:09:10.490
Harry: Now, a 2.5-inch difference

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:11.760
might not sound like a lot,

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.840
but if you factor that
into the surface area,

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.500
it's actually 58 square inches wider

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.260
than the UK's largest pizza,

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.210
which is almost a third of an increase.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.480
Joe: Am I looking at this right?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.730
Is it supposed to be six slices?

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.740
It's six slices. That can't be right.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.915
Six slices for a extra-large pizza?

00:09:28.915 --> 00:09:30.607
Look at the size of these slices!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.250
Harry: Now, hot coffees in
the UK come in four sizes.

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.410
Firstly, we have a short
coffee, which is 8 ounces.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.860
Joe: The short, 8 ounces.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:45.210
Harry: Then we have a tall
coffee, which is 12 ounces.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:46.900
Joe: Next we have the tall,

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.047
12 ounces.
Harry: Next

00:09:48.047 --> 00:09:51.525
is a grande coffee, which
comes in at 16 ounces.

00:09:51.525 --> 00:09:53.517
Joe: Then we got the grande,

00:09:53.517 --> 00:09:54.350
16 ounces.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.770
Harry: A venti, or 20 ounces.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.900
Joe: Aah, sensational.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.400
And the biggest one,

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:00.750
the venti,

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.678
20 ounces.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.910
And in case you're wondering,
it's called the venti

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.677
because 20 in Italian is venti-twento.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:12.603
Harry: Just to double-check,

00:10:12.603 --> 00:10:15.253
we're going to measure the
largest hot coffee in the UK.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.120
So, our venti coffee actually
came to closer to 18 ounces.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.570
Sort that out, Starbucks.
Where's my 2 ounces?

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:30.190
Joe: Now I'm going to
measure the venti coffee,

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.590
which should be 20 ounces,

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.007
minus a few sips.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:37.703
Wait.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.253
I came prepared.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.855
Whoa, come on!

00:10:45.855 --> 00:10:47.450
I did not drink that much.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.313
Oh, Starbucks!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.450
That's not, no, that's not even two,

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.880
that's, like, an ounce.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.521
Harry: The cold coffees in
the UK come in three sizes.

00:10:57.376 --> 00:10:58.410
The tall.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.126
Joe: The tall,

00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:01.380
12 ounces.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.263
Harry: The grande.

00:11:02.263 --> 00:11:04.400
Joe: We got the grande.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.530
Harry: And venti.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.100
Joe: Here's where things get kinda weird.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.950
Our venti iced is 24 ounces,

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:14.039
and we have another
size up, trenti, right?

00:11:14.039 --> 00:11:14.872
Producer: Trenta.

00:11:14.872 --> 00:11:15.920
Joe: Trenta.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.220
And that is

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.883
30 ounces.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:27.053
Harry: So, a UK cold venti
is exactly 20 ounces.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:32.860
Joe: Yeah, 21.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.710
I thought they said this
was supposed to be 24.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.310
"How many

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:38.820
fluid ounces

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.170
venti

00:11:41.366 --> 00:11:43.240
iced?"

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.823
24.

00:11:44.823 --> 00:11:46.500
And how much is it, 21?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.607
Starbucks. With the ice,
you still don't have enough.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.310
Harry: With Subway in the UK,

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.660
you can get sandwiches
in four different sizes.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:02.100
Firstly, we have toasted bites,

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.080
a 6-inch sub,

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.946
a foot-long sub,

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.535
and then

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.090
you can get a platter.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.810
Joe: And in the US, we have three sizes,

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.190
the 6-inch,

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.690
the foot-long,

00:12:21.948 --> 00:12:22.781
there you go.

00:12:22.781 --> 00:12:24.868
For you and your team,

00:12:24.868 --> 00:12:25.806
[groans]

00:12:25.806 --> 00:12:27.102
the big boy.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.490
Party platter.

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:31.398
The old Subway platypus.

00:12:31.398 --> 00:12:33.420
Harry: Now, in the UK, a
platter looks like this.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.115
What they do is they make
four foot-long sandwiches,

00:12:36.115 --> 00:12:37.920
then they cut those into fours,

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.080
so you're left with 16 pieces,

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.510
each of which is 3 inches.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.020
Joe: And for the party platter here,

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.490
they take five sandwiches,

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.220
cutting them into three pieces,

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.370
giving you 15 sandwiches total.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.531
In addition, in the US,
you can also get yourself

00:12:52.531 --> 00:12:55.802
a 3-foot-long party sub.

00:12:55.802 --> 00:12:57.320
[laughing]

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:58.770
Look at this thing!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:00.270
This is ridiculous!

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:01.230
Uh, three feet,

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.283
so that is,

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:04.460
what's that in...

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.735
what do you got in the UK?

00:13:05.735 --> 00:13:07.751
That's 17 meters?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.433
I have no idea.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.570
Yeah.

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.850
Harry: If you're a fan
of Subway's cookies,

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.683
in the UK, those come in three sizes.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.605
One cookie,

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.493
three cookies,

00:13:25.293 --> 00:13:27.480
or 12 cookies.

00:13:28.496 --> 00:13:30.760
Joe: In the US Subway, you can get

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.065
a single cookie,

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.688
a dozen cookies,

00:13:35.688 --> 00:13:37.480
right like that,

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:38.313
or,

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:40.933
the

00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:43.331
[grunts] hang on! Keep rolling.

00:13:43.331 --> 00:13:44.806
The

00:13:44.806 --> 00:13:48.008
36-cookie platter.

00:13:48.008 --> 00:13:49.791
Booyah!

00:13:49.791 --> 00:13:51.476
[laughing]

00:13:51.476 --> 00:13:53.684
I'm like in Vegas, baby! All in!

